# ── Generated by setup.sh — IDE-specific AIDLC workflow rules ────────────────
# These are per-developer generated artifacts. Re-create with ./setup.sh
# The only committed entry-point is .ai/AGENT.md (project overview).
#
# What IS committed (source of truth, maintained in this repo):
#   extensions/glue/          — preamble + handoff rules
#   extensions/skills/        — custom skills (e.g. coordinating-agent)
#   extensions/org-standards/ — team rules
#   extensions/integrations/  — Jira/Confluence opt-in rules
#
# What is NOT committed (generated by setup.sh from the above + upstreams):

